=== intro

Voices raised in the mess. The long dark wears on everyone differently—cabin fever, old grudges, the weight of too much void and not enough sky.

Two of your crew stand chest to chest, grievances spilling out that have been building for cycles.

* [Intervene and mediate]
  ~ morale += 10
  ~ chronicle "Peace Restored"
    A dispute among the crew. Words were had. Understanding reached. The hold feels lighter.
  -> END

* [Let them work it out]
  ~ morale -= 5
  ~ chronicle "Unresolved Tension"
    The crew settled their dispute in their own way. Not cleanly.
  -> END

* [Confine both to quarters]
  ~ morale -= 10
  ~ chronicle "Discipline"
    Order maintained through authority. The crew obeys, but resentment simmers.
  -> END
